  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Action to Support the National Coordinating Committee on Combating and Preventing Trafficking in Persons to Create a Safe and Secure Environment in Egypt, Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to contribute to the Government of Egypt&apos;s efforts to ensure that trafficking in persons to, from and through Egypt is monitored and curbed and victims of trafficking are promptly identified and assisted. The main outcome, therefore, is to increase the efficacy of the National Coordinating Committee for Combating and Preventing Illegal Migration and Trafficking in Persons, other relevant Government of Egypt entities and national actors in preventing and combatting trafficking in persons in Egypt through the effective implementation of the current 2016-2021 strategy and contribution to the review and devise of a revised strategy for the years beyond the termination of the current strategy in 2021.</narrative>
  </description>
